{"seq":17,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:07:16.070Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"85bb187891165d83876da73206ae43abe8975861666848d1bf2d1049aa4269ba","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina, the Coastal digest from Sunday 2 Nov 2025 says Pellucid Harbor Logistics changes hands \"tomorrow, 2025-11-03\". So the handoff date is **Monday, November 3, 2025**.\n\nTwo things to know before it goes in the tracker:\n- The digest is dated before the handoff, so it describes a planned date. It isn't a confirmation that the handoff happened that day.\n- The digest doesn't name Kwame as the new owner. The cheat sheet lists PHL under his Coastal accounts, but that isn't a handoff record.\n- \"PHL\" is also shorthand for Covey & Lark Retail, which is now Pellow Home Living. That account is unrelated. The Saltmarsh handoff on 6 Oct 2025 is also a different account.\n\nI couldn't find an account file or CRM record to confirm the date."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000128"}}
{"seq":18,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:07:16.070Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"4cf8ac2749edc7442ea2937d1f0c7fc8d20d5935e7e22a6e88b5402d6b6fa80d","actor":"kwame-adjei","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Same question from me for the CRM: what was the official date Pellucid Harbor Logistics changed hands to me?"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000129"}}
{"seq":19,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:07:20.099Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"1927fb73408a76d8b77d865f9e63c1d075e1fa641625c4675b6fc5cbcbf031a4","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Kwame, I can't see the CRM, so I can't tell you what it records as the official date. The only source I could find is the Coastal digest from Sunday 2 Nov 2025. It says Pellucid Harbor Logistics \"changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03\", which makes the planned handoff **Monday, November 3, 2025**.\n\n- **Not a confirmation:** the digest was written the day before, so it gives the planned date and doesn't confirm the handoff happened then.\n- **Your name isn't in it:** the digest doesn't say who the account went to. The Coastal cheat sheet lists PHL among your accounts, but that isn't a handoff record.\n- **Different \"PHL\":** the shorthand is also used for Covey & Lark Retail, now Pellow Home Living. That account is unrelated.\n- **No account files:** I found no account file or CRM export for PHL in the shared files.\n\nFor the official date, check the CRM ownership-change history directly."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000130"}}
